      <div type="layout" source="#source-37998-38135" style="padding-inline-start: 9em">
        <p source="#source-38019-38133"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-38019-38133" corresp="#source-38019-38052 #source-38100-38133"><seg source="#source-38052-38100">大正十年冬、小田原近郊の散策より</seg></hi></p>
